     "param": "svg.model", "code": "missing_required_parameter"}


I tried it with Sunburst with both gpt-5.5 and gpt-5.6-sol, and the results were nothing spectacular. It’s something you could already do in the ChatGPT interface by asking it to convert an existing image to an equivalent SVG.https://imgpb.com/bkUrcRecraft is probably the only group I know of that had a native text-to-SVG generator pretty early on, but since it’s a closed model, I’m not familiar with what they were doing under the hood technically.https://fal.ai/models/fal-ai/recraft/v4/pro/text-to-vector

